{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-001.md","record_count":9,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s001-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","speaker_label":"பையன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா! டாக்டர் உங்களைக் கூப்பிடுறாரு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":10,"printed_page":9}],"source_scene_file":"scene-001.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s001-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","speaker_label":"டாக்டர்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சீக்கிரம் குணமாகிவிடும், வருத்தப்படாதீங்க... இப்படி வாம்மா","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":10,"printed_page":9}],"source_scene_file":"scene-001.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s001-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன டாக்டர்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":10,"printed_page":9}],"source_scene_file":"scene-001.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s001-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","speaker_label":"டாக்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்பா நல்ல வேலையா பிழைத்து விட்டார்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":10,"printed_page":9}],"source_scene_file":"scene-001.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s001-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ரொம்ப 'தேங்க்ஸ்' டாக்டர். அவர் கண்பார்வையெல்லாம் சரியா ஆயிட்டுதா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":10,"printed_page":9}],"source_scene_file":"scene-001.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s001-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","speaker_label":"டாக்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சாதாரண விபத்தா அவருக்கு? பிழைச்சதே ஆபூர்வமாயிற்றே! எதுக்கும் வீட்டுக்கு அழைச்சிக்கிட்டுப்போயி மருந்தை விடாமல் சாப்பிடட்டும், பின்னாலே பார்ப்போம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":10,"printed_page":9}],"source_scene_file":"scene-001.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s001-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்படின்னா... அவன்கண்...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":10,"printed_page":9}],"source_scene_file":"scene-001.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s001-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","speaker_label":"டாக்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்போதே முன் கூட்டியே சொல்லியிருக்கேனேயம்மா—அவருக்கு வயது ஆயிடுச்சு. இனி கண்பார்வை வருவது சந்தேகந்தான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":10,"printed_page":9}],"source_scene_file":"scene-001.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s001-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s001","scene_ordinal":1,"transition_audit_id":"T001","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்பா!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":10,"printed_page":9}],"source_scene_file":"scene-001.md"}]}